  dct:description """The Service Provider provides advice and support to Gasunie in order to guarantee the integrity of the offshore pipe line between Bacton (UK) and Balgzand (NL). The provided support and advice will take place in collaboration with Gasunie and specialist third parties contracted by Gasunie. 
Said  collaboration is to be coordinated by the service provider. In case measures are to be taken to safeguard the integrity of the pipeline these measures shall be aligned with these third parties and integrally proposed to Gasunie."""@en;
  dct:title "Integrity Management Support Services"@en;
  adms:identifier <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/0458e0c0-e4bd-4ac8-94b9-16d08667d4b2-01/Identifier/LOT-0000> .

